607912448754693.jpeg/T1plCtf8ZP0LJtQHK5QnoanFIG4n4ZYC-U3B3flNwd0\"/><figcaption>藤咲舞X戶口圖片</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"藤咲舞X戶口圖片\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250110/954430711572729856859032.jpeg/mmhdWonN3Dl-dOGRFCfU-hi2fPUeEzPXfQ8QtH0PELQ\"/><figcaption>藤咲舞X戶口圖片</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"藤咲舞X戶口圖片\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250110/954430713418354688184670.jpeg/pYxCx5WoZB8i6B96t6s04TfLnKoRyiQxOYRGhjmERoY\"/><figcaption>藤咲舞X戶口圖片</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"藤咲舞X戶口圖片\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250110/954430709500612608394528.jpeg/E9z-LNjyBei57qluTc_V8H-KpxxwOnkcGQW3bRkFt20\"/><figcaption>藤咲舞X戶口圖片</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"藤咲舞X戶口圖片\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250110/954430709722910720710365.jpeg/7VCBMGB0nSO133-wNnnJV5qXGTRFWrSJSkST40pEk-M\"/><figcaption>藤咲舞X戶口圖片</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"藤咲舞X戶口圖片\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250110/954430707541741568641528.jpeg/fQ-iaq5xuXSUhoVwpKOCqosxNylF5szNQ8Dhu0PA4bs\"/><figcaption>藤咲舞X戶口圖片</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"藤咲舞X戶口圖片\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250110/954430707713708032769325.jpeg/hiUSIkC5DGiZXW65NRyfQ05oSZbDr4XVRWIxsEViMbA\"/><figcaption>藤咲舞X戶口圖片</figcaption></figure><p>為救洗腎妻掏空存款！陸網紅「半夜突叫兩聲」翻眼猝逝　享年38歲</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T02:38:34.480203+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1826,"images":44,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T02:30:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T04:17:40.636834+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T02:37:37.655067+00:00","content_hash":"204daf272c6e3baed72da84286870bc7aa853540b0f8ebacae02d131f33f9214","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}